                                  ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
                                  │pgctl keys                                                    │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │Moving                                                        │
                                  │h l / ← →  previous / next panel                              │
                                  │j k / ↑ ↓  move within a panel                                │
                                  │1-5        jump straight to a panel                           │
                                  │g G        first / last row                                   │
                                  │[ ]        previous / next tab of the detail pane             │
                                  │tab        focus the detail pane, and back                    │
                                  │/          filter the focused panel                           │
                                  │esc        clear the filter, or leave the pane                │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │Doing                                                         │
                                  │ctrl+p     every command, with the key that runs it           │
                                  │n          take a snapshot — choose the databases             │
                                  │a          apply the selected snapshot — choose target and sc…│
                                  │m          move one connection's data into another            │
                                  │p          prune snapshots by the retention policy            │
                                  │x          delete the selected snapshot                       │
                                  │r          reload snapshots and re-probe connections          │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │In a form                                                     │
                                  │↑ ↓        move between fields                                │
                                  │← →        change a choice                                    │
                                  │space      toggle                                             │
                                  │enter      run it, or plan it                                 │
                                  │esc        cancel                                             │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │Reading a plan                                                │
                                  │↑ ↓        scroll it — nothing has been touched yet           │
                                  │w          widen to the referential closure and re-plan       │
                                  │enter      apply it                                           │
                                  │esc        back to the form                                   │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │↓ 4 more                                                      │
                                  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯